'''100 Thieves''' is an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization based in [[wikipedia:Los Angeles|Los Angeles, California]]. formed by former [[:callofduty:OpTic Gaming|OpTic Gaming]] Call of Duty player, co-owner and personality, Matthew ''"[[callofduty:Nadeshot|Nadeshot]]"'' Haag and NBA team ''[[wikipedia:Cleveland Cavaliers|Cleveland Cavaliers]]''.

